ses[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]llm_usage_limit_auto_disable.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/llm_usage_limit_auto_disable.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-n4[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-n4/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Usage-limit detection core[/bold #D7AFFF]                                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]detect[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]detect: add the `llm_provider.usage_limit` config section, its JSON [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]schema, the `llm_default_usage_limit_config` plugin hook, evidence-based[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]built-in patterns for every shipped provider, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]normalize/match/exclude plus reset-hint parsing logic, with a regression[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]corpus of real captured provider messages.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Runtime disable and retry precedence[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]enforce[dim] · [dim][/dim]after detect[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]enforce: call detection from the LLM invocation error paths, write the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]temporary provider disable through the existing Rust-backed store with a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]structured source, make a usage-limit failure take precedence over the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]retry loop so agents stop sleeping through futile waits, and record [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]telemetry.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rich usage-limit notification[/bold #D7AFFF]                                 [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]notify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after enforce[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]notify: add a notification sender that reports which provider was [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]disabled, for how long and until when, what the provider actually said, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and which agent tripped it, with once-per-disable-window dedup.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Surface the disable reason and document the feature[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]surface[dim] · [dim][/dim]after enforce[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]surface: render automatic versus manual provenance in the Models panel [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the top-bar provider-disable indicator, and document the new config [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]section in the default config and user docs.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-n4","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-n4.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-1d3236127b29d36aba22206933685800","started_at":"2026-08-16T14:37:49.164701+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1786897494,"sha":"c9ef675105258e853f80629628c6826f9ad33fe2","subject":"feat(llm-provider): auto-disable providers on usage-limit errors"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"a66c672c0b1742fb332ce26cc794e08d2baa7e0abadf6eb784ace8f8fedc177b","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-n4.2/commits.json","size_bytes":242},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-n4.2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"67c09c9b4ce51cc5321f26f03f