D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]under real contention.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Correct matching, provider attribution, and end-to-end [/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]behavior[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]runtime-correctness[dim] · [dim][/dim]after atomic-disable[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]runtime-correctness: consume the atomic store result in usage-limit [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]enforcement, make replace_patterns literal even for an empty list, keep [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]retry attribution pinned to the execution provider recorded for each [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]attempt including fallback attempts, and add a full fakey [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]invocation-to-disable-to-notification acceptance test that proves one [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]attempt, unchanged error propagation, and no collateral provider [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]disable.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Restore disable provenance and document usage-limit policy[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]surface-and-document[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]surface-and-document: render automatic, manual, and unknown disable [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]provenance in the current split Launch Control provider modules and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]top-bar tooltip, add the commented usage_limit configuration block [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]without disturbing newer config fields, document detection, reset hints,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]machine-wide expiry, clearing, retry precedence, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]extension/replacement semantics, and cover the surfaces including [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]intentional visual snapshots.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-n4.5","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-n4.5.1","re